      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "RIGHT PATH (7) racing well without winning, placing at his last five runs. Last time finished 2nd over 300m at Healesville beaten 1.5 lengths (16.90) behind Gunai Rambo in a Maiden on August 2. Racing well and deserves a win. LEMONADE LASS (1) raced close the lead throughout and copped a check in the run, finishing a 9 length fourth (25.86) in a Maiden at Ballarat. Bold showing expected on best. PROVISIONAL (6) returned a better run last time, finishing in the money (22.85) at this track behind My Mate in a Maiden. Turned chasing the leaders but kept coming. Expected to feature. EYE OF STORM (2) is by Paua Of Buddy out of Mayfair's Dream making debut. Drawn well and should get his chance. Can run a bold race on debut.",
